WEBVTT

00:07.132 --> 00:12.095
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

00:12.095 --> 00:16.892
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle♪

00:16.892 --> 00:26.693
(Even Given the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,
I'm Actually the Strongest)

00:26.693 --> 00:31.448
♪A fleeting dream I had is falling now♪

00:31.448 --> 00:35.327
♪The loneliness remains as my power♪

00:36.703 --> 00:40.624
♪To a life that is drifting away♪

00:40.624 --> 00:43.835
♪The magic sprinkles upon♪

00:45.254 --> 00:50.008
♪I pick up the fragments
and tightly tether them♪

00:50.008 --> 00:54.680
♪I always keep them as
my source of strength in my heart♪

00:54.680 --> 00:56.932
♪See the world through my eyes♪

00:56.932 --> 00:59.268
♪And you'll get your treasure♪

00:59.268 --> 01:04.772
♪Let's go around the world and find it out♪

01:05.983 --> 01:10.362
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

01:10.821 --> 01:15.492
♪Everything's possible
I've overcome a lot so far♪

01:15.492 --> 01:20.372
♪Because you have given it to me♪

01:20.372 --> 01:27.170
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle, for good♪

01:36.513 --> 01:39.975
What do I do?
She started crying!

01:39.975 --> 01:43.228
It's okay, you're safe.

01:43.228 --> 01:45.522
I'm not here to hurt you.

01:45.522 --> 01:48.525
I can make a funny face too. Look...

01:52.279 --> 01:55.678
May! It's me, Yuri!

01:56.575 --> 01:57.576
Yu...

01:58.751 --> 02:01.788
Yu! It's really you!

02:01.788 --> 02:04.082
It's been so long, hasn't it?

02:04.082 --> 02:04.750
Yeah!

02:05.292 --> 02:08.002
Long time no see you
both too, Pii and Aice!

02:08.002 --> 02:09.463
Yo!

02:09.463 --> 02:11.506
It's Alice, May.

02:11.506 --> 02:12.883
Aice!

02:15.886 --> 02:23.602
You see, I started making flower crowns
once I heard everyone's coming here.

02:23.602 --> 02:26.396
The thing is, I haven't finished them yet.

02:26.396 --> 02:29.524
I fell asleep halfway.

02:29.524 --> 02:33.278
Thank you, May.
That makes me so happy.

02:33.945 --> 02:35.030
Oh, I know!

02:35.030 --> 02:37.157
Let's shape it this way,
and then...

02:38.408 --> 02:39.284
See?

02:39.284 --> 02:40.952
It looks good on you!

02:41.787 --> 02:45.582
We can finish the rest later, okay?

02:45.583 --> 02:46.369
Okay!

02:47.042 --> 02:49.836
How is it? Am I beautiful?

02:49.836 --> 02:52.297
You're gorgeous, dear.

02:52.297 --> 02:55.550
Will this make me super popular?

02:55.550 --> 02:58.929
Many will want to see
you everywhere!

02:58.929 --> 03:03.183
Oh, no. That'd be a problem since
there's only one May here.

03:03.183 --> 03:05.769
I'm glad she stopped crying.

03:05.769 --> 03:07.437
Thanks, Yuri.

03:07.437 --> 03:08.939
Yu! Look out!

03:09.940 --> 03:13.777
There's a scary person shooting
everywhere outside.

03:13.777 --> 03:15.612
It must be him!

03:15.612 --> 03:16.697
What?

03:16.697 --> 03:20.242
You're mistaken, May!
He is Ein.

03:20.242 --> 03:24.621
He's the good guy who sent
the scary person away!

03:24.621 --> 03:25.747
Is that so?

03:25.747 --> 03:26.957
That is so.

03:27.816 --> 03:30.293
I'm sorry for mistaking you.

03:30.293 --> 03:33.046
It's okay. I might've startled you too.

03:37.008 --> 03:38.844
Wh-What is it?

03:38.844 --> 03:41.847
I would like to sit on your lap.

03:43.223 --> 03:44.349
Sure.

03:45.809 --> 03:46.601
Come here.

03:48.854 --> 03:50.814
Now, please pat my head!

03:50.814 --> 03:51.940
All right.

03:53.358 --> 03:55.277
Would you please lift me up?

03:55.277 --> 03:56.361
Okay.

03:57.112 --> 04:03.869
Up, up we go!

04:03.869 --> 04:05.495
Higher!

04:05.495 --> 04:07.497
Even higher!

04:07.497 --> 04:09.583
More!

04:09.583 --> 04:11.126
All right! You got it!

04:11.752 --> 04:14.254
All the way up we... go!

04:17.257 --> 04:19.259
Huh? Wait.

04:19.259 --> 04:21.762
Isn't this way too high?

04:22.554 --> 04:24.765
I think we're in trouble.

04:24.765 --> 04:29.853
Once May starts crying, it won't be
over for a week straight.

04:31.646 --> 04:33.607
Let's distract her with sweets!

04:33.607 --> 04:40.322
I guess he just can't win
over every spirit, eh.

04:43.413 --> 04:44.659
Looks like they're back.

04:53.460 --> 04:54.130
Ah...

04:54.169 --> 04:55.295
Ah...

04:56.170 --> 04:58.047
Ahahaha!

04:58.048 --> 05:00.175
That was fun!

05:02.093 --> 05:03.929
Now for the results!

05:03.929 --> 05:07.182
I have decided to officially
enlist Big Brother Ein...

05:07.182 --> 05:09.935
...to May's favorites list!

05:09.935 --> 05:13.438
What a relief!
Congrats to you.

05:13.438 --> 05:18.068
We were this close
to a crying disaster.

05:18.068 --> 05:19.444
By the way...

05:19.444 --> 05:24.324
I would like to tag along
with all of you.

05:24.324 --> 05:25.206
Huh?

05:26.660 --> 05:29.830
I'd love to have them together
as a family, but...

05:29.830 --> 05:31.685
What do you think, Kursh?

05:31.686 --> 05:33.333
It should be fine.

05:33.333 --> 05:36.806
I want to respect May's wishes.

05:36.807 --> 05:39.840
You can entrust this place to me.

05:39.840 --> 05:41.925
Wait, you're not coming?

05:42.759 --> 05:44.094
Didn't I tell you?

05:44.094 --> 05:45.512
I'm here to...

05:45.512 --> 05:47.347
That's not what I'm asking.

05:47.848 --> 05:50.350
I'm not asking about your duty.

05:50.350 --> 05:52.978
I'm asking about your wish.

05:54.104 --> 05:56.231
Just like how you respect May's wishes,

05:56.231 --> 05:59.860
I want to respect
what you want to do.

06:01.169 --> 06:02.247
Ein...

06:03.135 --> 06:06.933
I'm sure you really want to
be with your sisters, right?

06:08.702 --> 06:10.896
Guess I can't fool an Appraiser, eh.

06:10.897 --> 06:13.665
You even appraised my heart.

06:13.665 --> 06:16.167
I don't need to do that.

06:17.460 --> 06:19.796
You don't have to worry
about this place.

06:19.796 --> 06:21.756
To keep it intact at all times,

06:21.756 --> 06:25.135
I'll set up a barrier and
leave a clone behind.

06:26.261 --> 06:28.263
Thank you, Einsy.

06:33.059 --> 06:36.146
These are both of our Spirit Cores.

06:36.146 --> 06:39.649
I'll leave them to you, Einsy.

06:39.649 --> 06:41.693
Got it!

06:42.527 --> 06:46.281
Good news, my sisters!

06:46.281 --> 06:50.785
Aside from May, I will also
tag along with you all!

06:52.287 --> 06:54.789
Yay!

06:54.789 --> 06:58.960
May, I promise I'll protect
your Yggdrasil.

06:58.960 --> 07:00.337
So don't worry.

07:00.337 --> 07:03.048
Thank you so much.

07:03.757 --> 07:07.260
Thank you, Ein. I love you.

07:09.346 --> 07:12.057
Thank you, Ein.

07:12.057 --> 07:13.308
I also...

07:13.308 --> 07:16.811
...also

07:17.520 --> 07:21.566
- I also love...
- I'm afraid you need to be louder, Alice.

07:22.901 --> 07:27.697
With this, I've managed to reunite
Yuri with four of her family members.

07:27.697 --> 07:30.450
This is going to get even livelier.

07:30.450 --> 07:32.786
There are still four more left.

07:32.786 --> 07:35.080
But I believe you can do it.

07:37.082 --> 07:40.835
You know, I used to hate myself.

07:42.003 --> 07:43.755
I keep doubting myself.

07:44.798 --> 07:48.176
My heart was filled with
nothing but negativity.

07:52.430 --> 07:57.560
But, meeting Yuri and others has made
me want to support and protect them.

07:57.560 --> 08:01.940
I want to keep their smiles. That wish has
filled my heart with warmth.

08:02.816 --> 08:06.319
I'm filled with strength from deep
inside when I'm with them.

08:06.945 --> 08:09.739
For the first time, I finally learned
to love myself.

08:10.865 --> 08:14.119
I'm really proud to be able to
protect their smiles.

08:14.786 --> 08:18.289
And I will continue to hold myself high.

08:18.289 --> 08:19.624
That's what I think.

08:39.144 --> 08:42.020
Wait, why am I saying all this?

08:42.020 --> 08:44.816
I feel like I can tell you
anything, Ursula.

08:44.816 --> 08:47.068
Is it because you are my master?

08:49.195 --> 08:50.030
Ursula?

08:51.239 --> 08:55.702
It's nothing! Just hand me
the Spirit Cores, will ya?

08:55.702 --> 08:57.203
I'll leave it to you.

09:01.207 --> 09:05.712
You've got the Void Evil Eye from Kursh
and Tree of Genesis from May.

09:05.712 --> 09:06.588
Got it.

09:06.588 --> 09:08.840
Also, your spirit's prosthetic
eye has leveled up.

09:08.840 --> 09:11.468
Now you can analyze auras.

09:11.468 --> 09:14.345
Wow. Another amazing ability.

09:14.345 --> 09:19.768
The Void Evil Eye can make
anything you look at disappear.

09:19.768 --> 09:20.852
Disappear?

09:20.852 --> 09:24.481
It causes things to cease to exist.

09:24.481 --> 09:29.527
But it drains a lot of mana and strains
the eye a lot. It's also hard to control.

09:29.527 --> 09:34.115
Well, I'm sure your Divine
Spirit's Eye won't break.

09:34.115 --> 09:35.283
Break?

09:35.867 --> 09:41.331
We're not sure of its side effects,
so I advise you to not overuse it.

09:41.331 --> 09:44.626
Got it. I'll only use it in emergencies.

09:45.585 --> 09:48.505
By the way, my skill can freely
manipulate trees.

09:48.505 --> 09:49.881
Look, look!

09:53.426 --> 09:56.638
Amazing! I can see lots of
potential use cases!

09:56.638 --> 09:57.430
(Aura Appraisal)

09:57.430 --> 09:59.933
(Aura Appraisal)
And there's Aura Appraisal.

09:59.934 --> 10:03.311
Aura is essentially
the energy that surrounds us.

10:04.020 --> 10:09.109
Higher-level demons can manipulate
aura at will and use it for offenses.

10:09.109 --> 10:13.363
Ioana looked down on you
and didn't get to use it, though.

10:13.363 --> 10:15.406
She wasn't even taking me seriously, eh?

10:16.116 --> 10:20.370
Not to mention, your sword is
imbued with Sacred Power.

10:20.370 --> 10:25.416
Whenever you strike a demon, you absorb
its aura and grow stronger.

10:25.416 --> 10:27.752
For real?! That's incredible!

10:27.752 --> 10:30.672
I might be able to stand on par
with demons with this.

10:30.672 --> 10:32.465
Thank you, Ursula!

10:36.719 --> 10:38.638
The honorable, lords of the Herzog.

10:38.638 --> 10:41.266
Thank you for taking the time
to gather here.

10:41.766 --> 10:44.269
I believe it's time to
put an end to Ein's life,

10:44.269 --> 10:47.772
a threat to the resurrection of the
Demon King, once and for all...

10:52.569 --> 10:54.060
Listen up, everyone.

10:54.061 --> 10:58.700
This castle, which once was Nigun's,
will be our stronghold.

10:58.700 --> 11:04.831
And that is why today we're starting
Operation Castle Cleanup!

11:04.831 --> 11:07.083
Yes! Let's do our best!

11:07.083 --> 11:10.170
Yuri, my dear. Make sure to let
me know when you're tired.

11:10.170 --> 11:13.089
I'll blow the whole castle away for you.

11:13.089 --> 11:16.843
A cleanup? What a pain.

11:16.843 --> 11:22.724
Pina. I allowed you to be out here because
I hope we can fix that attitude of yours.

11:22.724 --> 11:24.517
I hope you get what I mean.

11:25.600 --> 11:29.585
I'll do my best. I want to show
Ein a good side of me!

11:29.586 --> 11:30.607
Let's go!

11:31.691 --> 11:34.611
Mmm... More drinks...

11:34.611 --> 11:37.739
But I want to play hide-and-seek!

11:37.739 --> 11:42.118
Hide-and-seek, I say. Come on,
let's hide-and-seek!

11:44.559 --> 11:46.372
This will be hard.

11:46.739 --> 11:51.586
Anyway, Jasper is bringing our supplies
over from the other mansion.

11:51.586 --> 11:53.213
So let's tidy things up!

11:53.755 --> 11:57.550
Nigun has lived alone in this
massive castle for so long,

11:57.550 --> 11:59.260
so it's full of dust and cobwebs.

11:59.260 --> 12:01.763
Let's all work together
to clean it up!

12:02.263 --> 12:05.266
Pair up with your guardian.
May, pair up with Kursh.

12:05.266 --> 12:06.809
Alice, pair up with me.

12:08.811 --> 12:11.981
All right, then. Let's start
Operation Castle Cleanup!

12:11.981 --> 12:14.025
Let's go!

12:15.235 --> 12:17.904
Whoa. There's a lot to clean.

12:17.904 --> 12:21.157
I'm sorry that you can't
pair up with Akahane.

12:21.908 --> 12:23.034
I don't mind.

12:23.034 --> 12:26.913
I really wish that she could
come with us.

12:26.913 --> 12:32.103
I'll make sure that we can
be together again.

12:32.104 --> 12:33.419
So, just wait, okay?

12:34.295 --> 12:35.045
Okay.

12:35.755 --> 12:36.759
I will.

12:37.715 --> 12:42.929
A room full of books like this really
reminds me of the first time we met.

12:42.929 --> 12:46.140
Me too. Except, Mother isn't here with us.

12:46.140 --> 12:49.435
It's really just Ein and me now.

12:51.187 --> 12:54.274
Now is my chance to tell him how I feel!

12:55.900 --> 12:58.820
You're really not the type to
hide your affection, eh.

12:58.820 --> 13:00.905
Did he realize how I feel?

13:01.656 --> 13:05.576
What do I do?

13:07.036 --> 13:08.204
I mean, me too!

13:09.872 --> 13:15.169
I mean, me too!

13:17.672 --> 13:22.010
Reading books expands our knowledge
and our views about the world.

13:22.010 --> 13:24.470
That's why I get your love for books.
I love them too.

13:24.470 --> 13:26.723
Also, isn't the smell
of paper just lovely?

13:27.682 --> 13:28.975
Wait, Alice?

13:29.475 --> 13:30.768
Are you ok—

13:33.229 --> 13:38.735
Love... me? Ein, he...
Does he love me?

13:39.485 --> 13:42.488
Alice?! Calm yourself do—

13:45.366 --> 13:47.994
Phew. That should do it.

13:48.995 --> 13:51.748
How are things on your end, Pina?

13:55.293 --> 13:57.712
Done with no spots, of course!

13:57.712 --> 13:59.756
Who knew cleaning could be this—

14:00.631 --> 14:05.345
Oh, Pina... Do you really think you can
deceive me with your illusions?

14:05.345 --> 14:08.139
You have three seconds to
get up and start cleaning.

14:08.139 --> 14:11.392
Three, two, one.

14:13.144 --> 14:17.190
Ahaha. I was just taking a break, really.

14:17.190 --> 14:19.901
Geez, I was obviously joking, Mama.

14:19.901 --> 14:22.320
Pina.

14:22.320 --> 14:25.907
I'm sorry! I'll start right away!
Please spare me!

14:26.407 --> 14:28.534
We're in charge of cleaning the bath!

14:28.534 --> 14:30.661
(Fidget)
I'll make sure everyone can enjoy bathing!

14:30.661 --> 14:32.038
(Fidget)
You'll slip if you run around like—

14:32.038 --> 14:32.538
You'll slip if you run around like—

14:34.290 --> 14:37.751
Yuri! I will save you!

14:37.752 --> 14:39.379
I managed to balance myself.

14:41.672 --> 14:44.509
Are you okay, Mother?!

14:45.134 --> 14:48.930
Ah, yeah, this is nothing...

14:48.930 --> 14:52.725
You shouldn't be
overprotective towards me.

14:52.725 --> 14:55.144
I can handle cleaning just fine.

14:55.144 --> 14:57.313
But Yuri, I just...

14:57.313 --> 15:02.276
You know, it's really fun doing
things like this.

15:02.276 --> 15:04.821
I didn't have the chance to
when we were in Yggdrasil.

15:04.821 --> 15:08.282
So now, I want to try everything.

15:08.282 --> 15:12.829
Being able to do things myself
makes me really happy.

15:12.829 --> 15:14.205
Yuri...

15:14.205 --> 15:17.583
I'm really grateful to Ein, Mother.

15:17.583 --> 15:19.961
He showed me many sides of myself.

15:19.961 --> 15:24.215
The me who enjoys cleaning
is one example.

15:24.215 --> 15:28.261
When Ein is happy, it makes me happy too.

15:28.261 --> 15:31.472
That's something I only recently
discovered about myself.

15:32.223 --> 15:33.474
I see...

15:34.517 --> 15:37.228
If you are happy, then so am I.

15:37.228 --> 15:42.817
Let's make him cry tears of joy
from our clean, shiny bath.

15:42.817 --> 15:44.235
Let's do it!

15:45.319 --> 15:48.739
Wow, that's a lot of dust.

15:48.739 --> 15:52.994
I'm not sure what this room is, but it
looks like a lot of work to clean.

15:53.494 --> 15:55.496
Let's air it out.

15:55.496 --> 15:58.082
Ku! Ku! Look at this!

15:58.749 --> 16:00.751
I found a cockroach!

16:03.004 --> 16:07.216
May I keep it? I'll take care of it!

16:07.216 --> 16:09.510
May I, may I?

16:09.510 --> 16:11.012
Throw it out, now!

16:11.012 --> 16:12.930
- But, why?
- Eek!

16:12.930 --> 16:14.515
Get that thing away from me!

16:15.516 --> 16:18.102
It's so cute, though.

16:18.102 --> 16:19.770
Goodbye, Mr. Cockroach.

16:19.770 --> 16:21.731
That was close...

16:21.731 --> 16:24.817
I almost activated my Evil Eye!

16:24.817 --> 16:26.527
Ku! Look at this!

16:26.527 --> 16:28.029
What is it this time?

16:28.029 --> 16:32.450
Oh? Well, that is such a cute dress.

16:32.450 --> 16:35.578
I see, this must be the dressing room!

16:35.578 --> 16:39.081
I want to wear this.
I want to be a princess.

16:39.081 --> 16:43.085
You'd totally look great in it!
I can tell just by looking.

16:43.085 --> 16:47.089
There's also one for you. Here!

16:47.840 --> 16:49.091
Wow!

16:49.091 --> 16:51.469
What do you think?
Does it look good on me?

16:52.595 --> 16:54.430
(Chatter)
Should she show a little more skin?

16:54.430 --> 16:57.475
(Chatter)
Should she tease it to evoke more?

16:57.475 --> 16:59.602
- With her good figure...
- She started yapping.

16:59.602 --> 17:01.145
I know!

17:01.145 --> 17:02.605
Hmm? What is it?

17:02.605 --> 17:05.398
I have an idea!

17:08.743 --> 17:11.364
And the private room
has now been cleaned up!

17:11.364 --> 17:14.367
They should be done
cleaning about now.

17:14.367 --> 17:16.368
I'll help them out if they haven't.

17:27.880 --> 17:30.841
Ein, have you finished cleaning?

17:30.841 --> 17:33.803
Ah, yes. I'm done.

17:33.803 --> 17:36.138
Wait, what are you wearing, Yuri?

17:36.138 --> 17:42.770
Actually, after we finished, we decided to
hold a welcome party for Kursh and May.

17:42.770 --> 17:44.179
I see...

17:44.180 --> 17:49.111
They found the dressing room
and this dress when cleaning,

17:49.112 --> 17:50.778
so I borrowed it to wear.

17:51.779 --> 17:54.532
What do you think?
Do I look good in this?

17:54.532 --> 17:59.287
Yeah. Y-You look really... cute.

18:00.663 --> 18:01.622
I'm so happy!

18:02.957 --> 18:06.460
W-Well, then. I'll also help
with the preparations.

18:06.460 --> 18:08.796
It's already done.

18:08.796 --> 18:13.426
Actually, it's also a surprise
appreciation party for you.

18:13.426 --> 18:13.926
What?

18:13.926 --> 18:15.928
Though, I supposed I've spoiled it.

18:22.310 --> 18:24.729
What's up, Big bro.

18:25.206 --> 18:27.732
Good work, Ein.

18:31.235 --> 18:34.363
Come on here, Ein.

18:34.989 --> 18:38.993
My bad, Einsy. I already
started drinking.

18:38.993 --> 18:41.037
Look at me, Big Brother!

18:41.037 --> 18:43.623
Don't I look like a princess?

18:43.623 --> 18:45.416
W-Whoa!!

18:45.416 --> 18:47.376
Oh, my god. I might be so lucky
to be here...

18:47.376 --> 18:51.380
To be in the most luxurious
venue in the world!

18:51.380 --> 18:54.216
Y-You all look gorgeous.

18:54.216 --> 18:55.384
So beautiful!

18:57.053 --> 18:58.137
I see...

18:58.137 --> 19:02.266
What are you doing?
You change yourself too! Into this!

19:02.266 --> 19:04.994
Huh? I'm fine.

19:04.995 --> 19:05.770
What?

19:05.770 --> 19:07.730
Is that so?

19:08.773 --> 19:11.092
Enough whining
and start stripping already!

19:11.093 --> 19:12.777
Otherwise, you'll make Yuri sad!

19:17.531 --> 19:19.283
H-How do I look?

19:19.283 --> 19:22.036
Ein, you look like a prince!

19:22.036 --> 19:23.788
Hi there, handsome!

19:23.788 --> 19:28.209
Oh no. I can't look at him.
He's too dazzling!

19:28.209 --> 19:31.379
I picked that outfit for you!

19:31.379 --> 19:33.923
Don't I have the best sense of fashion?

19:33.923 --> 19:37.301
Thank you for picking
this cool attire for me, May.

19:37.301 --> 19:39.929
I'll also be in your care, Kursh.

19:39.929 --> 19:41.681
Enjoy the welcome party!

19:41.681 --> 19:43.933
I'm already enjoying it!

19:43.933 --> 19:47.520
Well, then. Shall we have a dance?

19:47.520 --> 19:50.690
But, I don't know how to dance.

19:54.193 --> 19:56.445
Come on! You too,
Big Sis Alice.

19:56.445 --> 19:58.130
Me too?

19:58.131 --> 19:58.948
Yes!

19:58.948 --> 20:03.202
I'm sure it'll be merrier
with everyone dancing!

20:08.708 --> 20:10.668
Come on, everyone!

20:10.668 --> 20:12.044
All righty.

20:12.044 --> 20:15.297
No dance will be complete
without the music, right?

20:15.297 --> 20:16.966
Leave it to me.

20:53.544 --> 20:56.422
Ein, thank you very much.

20:57.256 --> 21:02.011
You are the reason I can be
reunited with everyone.

21:10.099 --> 21:12.980
I'll make sure to find the rest.

21:16.692 --> 21:18.068
I'll trust you on that.

21:19.361 --> 21:23.491
I'm the happiest right now.

21:24.241 --> 21:28.496
I really wish this moment could
last forever and ever.

21:28.496 --> 21:29.747
It will.

21:32.500 --> 21:35.586
As long as you
and everyone are here,

21:35.586 --> 21:38.923
tomorrow will be
even better than today.

21:39.507 --> 21:44.512
And nothing makes me
happier than that.

21:45.721 --> 21:47.306
Ein...

21:47.306 --> 21:55.606
I'll make sure that fun days like these
will last until tomorrow and forever.

21:58.776 --> 21:59.662
Yes!

22:14.542 --> 22:19.880
♪No matter what trials you face,
no reason to be in such a hurry♪

22:19.880 --> 22:24.885
♪The wind will never stop carrying on,
as long as you have faith in yourself♪

22:24.885 --> 22:27.304
♪Never give up, the future's just ahead♪

22:27.304 --> 22:30.391
♪Just like rock music that will never die♪

22:33.394 --> 22:35.354
♪Keep on, keep on strumming!♪

22:37.356 --> 22:42.111
♪There are only pointless things
I have to do on my list♪

22:42.111 --> 22:46.991
♪Even the sun of my burning heart
has now completely sank♪

22:46.991 --> 22:51.996
♪I have completely lost track
of my whereabouts♪

22:51.996 --> 22:56.792
♪I wonder where it goes
The very thing I once cherished♪

22:58.085 --> 23:00.546
♪I drowned in hustle and bustle♪

23:00.546 --> 23:02.006
♪In the midst of loneliness♪

23:02.006 --> 23:08.888
♪Every person is being
made aware of reality♪

23:10.764 --> 23:16.186
♪As I was reaching the out of reach
I wasn't sure if I saw a mirage♪

23:16.186 --> 23:20.858
♪As long as you have faith in yourself
The future is possible for you to change♪

23:20.858 --> 23:23.527
♪Even if rocks get in your way forward♪

23:23.527 --> 23:26.113
♪You must stick to your will
and see it through♪

23:26.113 --> 23:31.035
♪Even if, the worst, everything fails
There will definitely be another chance♪

23:31.035 --> 23:33.454
♪The only one to rival is yourself♪

23:33.454 --> 23:35.998
♪Always set your sights
on to rock 'n' goal!♪

23:35.998 --> 23:36.624
(Even Given)

23:36.624 --> 23:37.207
(the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,)

23:37.207 --> 23:37.416
(I'm)

23:37.416 --> 23:37.583
(Actually)

23:37.583 --> 23:37.708
(the Strongest)
